Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:01:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:24.88,Sign - Copy,,750,0,500,,{\b0}Saturday \N Night \N and \N Sunday \N Morning{\b1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:30.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah, thank you for coming, Aramaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't believe we had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.30,0:03:39.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The one who badgered the Prime Minister into\Nordering us to come was you, Chairman Tadokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now, now, don't be so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:44.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ever since that theft of\Nelectronic funds occurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:48.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've become unwilling to trust security\Ncompanies and the Prefectural Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let us go to the heart of the\Nmatter and hear your concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well... Actually, that hacker...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:59.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hmm, what was her name...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:01.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I recall correctly, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:04.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cash Eye, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:09.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah, yes. She delivered this warning yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:15.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that robbery,\NI decided to convert my assets to cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:21.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, my entire fortune is currently stored\Nin this building's underground safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:23.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:27.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In a sense, that might be the best\Nsecurity you can provide for your wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:34.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought so myself, but last night, the hacker\Ntook remote control of a female house android.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:35.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though she was easily able to\Ninfiltrate the building and come to this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:42.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,she then deliberately destroyed the security\Ncamera to alert security about the breach,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:45.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and made her escape by leaping from this\Nwindow, fifty floors above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:53.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This would seem to be a message to us that\Nphysically preventing the robbery is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:55.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Judging from what you've told us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:01.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,this does not seem to fall\Nwithin Section 9's jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:07.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering their superior numbers, I believe it\Nwould be wiser to notify the Prefectural Police,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:10.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,rather than to ask Section 9,\Nwhich is a small, elite group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:13.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unfortunately, it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tomorrow night,\Nwhen the theft is supposed to take place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:21.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there will be a certain secret party here attended\Nby several political and business heavyweights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:27.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course, it's nothing illegal;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:30.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's just a private party for those\Nof us who share similar "tastes".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:34.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, it's not an event where we\Ncan tolerate any uncultured visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, we can neither\Nrelocate nor delay the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Important policies are sometimes\Nformulated at such events.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:49.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is why I need help from a\Nsource that is capable of discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:53.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will use the security company\Npersonnel to boost security.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:58.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My most pressing need is to have someone\Ncapable of supervising the entire operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:05.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears we cannot refuse, considering\Nthat the order has to come from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:07.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:11.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I now know why the Prime Minister recommended you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:15.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can almost smell her white blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:18.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She is not an android.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:20.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, my apologies,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:27.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the inorganic qualities of a multi-purpose, fully cybernetic\Nbody arouse my libido in the same way as an android does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:33.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She must really despise him. Prime Minister Kayabuki, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Regardless of your personal\Nimpressions regarding this affair,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you must understand that she is taking this course of action\Nto push through reforms that have been meeting resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:45.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering that she also seeks to eliminate the\Nprevious regime's lingering traces, it is a just move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A woman's grudge; how terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:53.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not happy about being made\Nan accomplice to her revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:58.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention the fact that I don't think it's a job\Nworth being made to give up our vacation for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:06.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A whole pile of even more infuriating things\Nawait tomorrow, so don't lose your temper now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:28.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:30.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sure can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, that guy who just arrived is an\Nexecutive at Hanka Precision Instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:41.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To think that political and business power brokers are attending\Na party behind their wives' backs to show off their "dutch" wives...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:42.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have the former Minister of Foreign Affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He'll never learn his lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:57.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:03.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, the Chief and Major have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This'll be interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Whoa, don't you think the old man's a\N{\i1}bit{\i} more enthusiastic than planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:27.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:31.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But anyway, look at the Major; she's\Nan instant hit with those freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Holy shit! Someone touched her butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.10,0:08:37.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ignorance is bliss, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:41.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, let's leave the passport into the\Nunderground safe to the Major,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and get started with our own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:47.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's head towards the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:53.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:55.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're all done over here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:58.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, wait for the Major's signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You have made a wise decision, Aramaki-kun.\NYour camouflage is exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:19.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My subordinates are already in position;\Ndiscreetly, so as not to disturb the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, consider our security measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:25.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even supposing that the\Nthief makes it into the safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I find it hard to believe that she'll\Nbe able to carry out all the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.95,0:09:31.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Her track record speaks for itself, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so catch her at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:40.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Until the time the theft will supposedly\Noccur, we should all join the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:41.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Would you like a short tour of my home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, status report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It doesn't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:10:02.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It now appears probable that Tadokoro's underground safe\Nwas reinforced with additional security devices a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:05.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've hacked the device maker's server,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:09.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the blueprints of all the newly installed\Ncomponents have already been deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:13.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their information security is very tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:16.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The hard copy of the blueprints\Nis probably lost as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:21.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Major has gone to retrieve Tadokoro's\Nretinal and cyberbrain patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if she succeeds in obtaining them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:27.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,her efforts won't matter if the\Nsafe itself can't be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:31.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll find another way to open it, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:32.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:37.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You may scoff at our outlandish tastes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:41.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but after our exhaustive experience\Nwith so many various pleasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:45.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we have come to find doll fetishism satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you think?\NEvery one of these dolls was custom made
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:52.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by a famous designer, from constituent parts.\NThey're "haute couture".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their bodies' functions are\Nnot so different from yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:11:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Would you happen to be interested\Nin trying on any of their bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, how is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:06.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This really is sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.63,0:11:11.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't help but indulge my habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:14.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, that body of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At first glance, it's just multi-purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:19.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's actually very elaborately\Nmade, down to the last detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:22.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let me guess; your skin's sensory\Nreceptor count must be 16 squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bear with it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know, but I wouldn't be\Nable to stomach his touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I've cut off input from my sensory organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:29.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how about a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Begin the operation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:36.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:42.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could it be that you want to make\Nlove to my body while I am "absent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:47.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You seem to understand my tastes very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.09,0:11:57.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wouldn't it be better to be able to treat a conscious\Nhuman being as if she were a doll, instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:06.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll leave my sensory input on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:09.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and won't make a single move...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:24.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry about that, but I don't want to risk letting\Nyou continue and giving you a heart attack, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, enjoy the rest in your dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:31.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, I've got the retinal\Nand cyberbrain patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:33.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right, let's proceed to stage two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:34.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou, Togusa, how are things on your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:51.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're just about to start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:57.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:12:59.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, this place is off limits...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:10.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've been sent by Tadokoro-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:23.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Security camera monitor footage switch complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good job, Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:25.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good. Now, we just have to wait\Nfor the Major to get here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:48.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were you able to get the info?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:49.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:06.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You might just as well have infiltrated\NTadokoro's cyberbrain and brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I couldn't quite do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's still something we need to have him do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can't we disable that system?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's an isolated system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:38.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you destroy it, the control centre will\Nimmediately notice that something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The system isn't a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:43.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's whether or not I can open the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I managed to work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:50.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've assessed the safe's structure, based on the scale\Nof the materials brought into the Tadokoro Building.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:56.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They've deliberately chosen an analog safe with a locking\Nmechanism that features four layers of antiquated locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wouldn't it be better to just bring Tadokoro here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't do that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:03.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, how about going with Code B?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:04.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, should be a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:09.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The explosives we have prepared should be more\Nthan enough to burn through the safe's supports.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:12.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, our operation will become\Nknown at that point in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:17.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if you manage to break into the safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:23.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't know what traps may be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There may be a double barrier, for all we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:29.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Nothing ventured, nothing gained."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:33.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since it's not our intention to steal\Ncash, I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:35.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right; let's go with Code B.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:39.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The rest of us can't get any\Ncloser to the safe, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:40.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you for your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Time to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll have to get going ourselves\Nto prep for the next stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:06.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So this is where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:08.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aramaki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:11.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's already this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:13.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How is the party going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:14.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No interruptions of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:17.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is almost the time when the\Ntheft is supposed to occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:19.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:21.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hope nothing happens, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, please hurry to the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:27.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears that we have an intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:29.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if it's almost time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:34.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:35.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:36.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've been waiting for your signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:38.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm ready to go anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe the building has switched\Nover to its internal power generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone, there is nothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:13.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, considering the nature of this\Nparty, we must avoid any accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:16.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please follow our instructions and\Nevacuate the hall as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.57,0:17:26.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the one that came here yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:28.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How did the hacker get all the way in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:31.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will send my team there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:32.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:38.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The hacker apparently intends to break into\Nthe safe, but either way she'll be cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What exactly do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When someone other than myself enters that safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,double security doors will close,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:52.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and they will not open again\Nwithout my "ghost" generated key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A "ghost" generated key...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:02.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly, find the hacker who\Nis remotely controlling that android!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That person's the one you should capture!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:06.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:09.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears that the figure we see on the\Nmonitors is either a completely independent AI
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or a full body cyborg. There is no evidence that\Na remote control signal is being transmitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:19.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then this is the hacker herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:23.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, we just received another warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.86,0:18:33.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aramaki-kun! Come with me to the safe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:36.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and confirm that the hacker's\Ndeath is legitimate self-defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:46.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The safe will be sealed off, and a near-vacuum\Nstate will persist for a length of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:50.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if the hacker's a full body cyborg,\Nthere's no way she can survive that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:53.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:06.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief... what about the Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, how is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:48.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you find the body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:51.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It does not seem to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Look closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry to have kept everyone waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:04.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's just that Chairman\NTadokoro was so impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:06.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:08.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, how did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:13.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The footage you saw of me going inside was\Nartificial imagery I had Tachikoma make.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:18.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,By the way, Chairman Tadokoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:24.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it safe to assume that these\Npiles of currency are all yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:27.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,judging from the fact that they are in this safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:29.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:33.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:40.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Look for the thief's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chairman Tadokoro, our true motive was\Nto make you open the safe yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:52.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so we could inspect the serial\Nnumbers of the bills within the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:59.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have obtained information that you are managing the rest\Nof former Secretary General Yakushima's hidden assets,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:02.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so we conducted a secret investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:03.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The serial numbers correspond with\Nthose given to us by the Tax Bureau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:11.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I doubt you can account for this legally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:17.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have quite a few questions for you,\Nso please come to headquarters with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:25.25,Sign,,0,375,475,,{\fs35}{\b1}We came \Nin to conduct an inspection{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:25.25,Sign,,700,0,700,,{\fs35}{\frz35}{\b1}Tax Bureau Inspections Division{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.67,0:21:27.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:31.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How are things going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:33.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're letting them go as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, there's a good possibility that more hidden\Ngold will come rolling out if we follow these leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are those people perverts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.65,0:21:55.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Or rather, hobbyists, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tadokoro Tsutomu,\Nthe former Chairman of Keidanren,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.89,0:22:11.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who is also said to have strong political ties,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.25,0:22:13.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,was arrested for suspected massive tax\Nevasion and laundering of slush funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.67,0:22:17.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Playing a thief was pretty fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:21.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, I was worried for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:27.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought you might become a vacuum-packed Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:31.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You know, it's called "teamwork" when you let\Nyour team members know your plan beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:36.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh? Thievery is a profession that\Nincludes deception as an ironclad rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.57,0:22:44.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How long do you intend to\Nfantasise about being a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:46.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's a lot of work to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe I should consider a new career...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.73,0:23:20.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:35.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.16,0:23:37.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.75,0:23:39.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.93,0:23:42.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:43.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.86,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.81,0:23:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.10,0:23:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:54.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:58.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:00.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:01.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:03.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:04.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.89,0:24:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\NI see inside, (the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:15.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.92,0:24:20.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.42,0:24:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
